                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Despite the name Rotten Edition, this game is not rotten game, it's brilliant platformer game.\nUnique concept with many kinds of zombie combined with a platformer game, and leveled game with star rating like Angry Bird.\n\nQuite a challenge to get 3 stars in some levels.\n1 star for reach the finish\n1 star for get all the brains\n1 star for finish the level below a certain time (this is the harder part), as time is still ticking while changing the zombie after a run.\n\nThere isn't much of a story, but the game mechanic and concept are good. Makes me want to play the next level over and over again. It usually the story that makes me want to continue the game.\nThere are 70 test levels within 5 phase with phase 1-4 contain 15 tests and phase 5 contains 10 tests.\n\nThere are also trading cards and achievements that makes it more fun to play.\nDefinitely recommended.",
